WEBVTT

00:00:01.760 --> 00:00:02.690
Is it ready yet?

00:00:03.210 --> 00:00:06.500
When will our new song be ready?

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:09.650
Indeed. The seconds are crawling by.

00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:13.390
Meganii's gonna let us know via PriPass when it's done, right?

00:00:13.390 --> 00:00:15.110
Yeah, I can't wait!

00:00:15.110 --> 00:00:16.200
What kind of song will it be?

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:18.850
Now now, there's no rush.

00:00:18.850 --> 00:00:20.500
Like they say: Good things come to those who wait.

00:00:20.830 --> 00:00:23.240
Hold up! "Wait" not "faint!"

00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:24.670
Pshu...

00:00:27.940 --> 00:00:36.890
New song!

00:00:37.930 --> 00:00:40.000
Your new song is here!

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:41.390
Huzzah!

00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:45.440
It's finished!

00:00:45.440 --> 00:00:46.990
What's finished?

00:00:46.990 --> 00:00:50.150
New dance moves? An outfit design?

00:00:52.070 --> 00:00:54.140
I made her look like me!

00:00:54.140 --> 00:00:57.960
What do you think you're doing! Don't you know the Idol Grand Prix is tomorrow?

00:00:57.960 --> 00:01:01.490
It's fine. Falulu will do well.

00:01:01.840 --> 00:01:06.750
Of course you will! Win, and this time we'll see that Paradise Coord glowing!

00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:08.120
Yeah!

00:02:44.660 --> 00:02:45.770
Hey there!

00:02:46.150 --> 00:02:47.180
Capisce!

00:02:47.700 --> 00:02:51.680
I read your lyric suggestions countless times.

00:02:51.680 --> 00:02:53.410
And to be frank...

00:03:01.540 --> 00:03:04.410
You... didn't like them-pri?

00:03:05.190 --> 00:03:08.620
I... was deeply moved!

00:03:10.540 --> 00:03:16.420
Your dedication to your friends was demonstrated to me very clearly.

00:03:16.420 --> 00:03:18.380
Now, here is your long-awaited new song!

00:03:18.770 --> 00:03:20.510
What's it like?

00:03:20.510 --> 00:03:21.890
To put it in a word...

00:03:21.890 --> 00:03:22.710
It's pop.

00:03:22.710 --> 00:03:23.350
Pri!

00:03:23.350 --> 00:03:23.980
Rock.

00:03:23.980 --> 00:03:24.420
Go!

00:03:24.420 --> 00:03:27.310
Full of excitement, but also soothing.

00:03:27.310 --> 00:03:32.690
Moreover, it has a jellyfish-like sense of transparency, and it's positively capisce!

00:03:32.690 --> 00:03:34.060
Amazing!

00:03:34.060 --> 00:03:36.330
Our qualities are in perfect balance!

00:03:36.330 --> 00:03:37.980
So it's a mix of everything!

00:03:37.980 --> 00:03:39.960
Thank you very much!

00:03:39.960 --> 00:03:43.280
By the way, did you learn anything about the Falulu mystery?

00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:44.300
No...

00:03:45.480 --> 00:03:46.660
However...

00:03:46.660 --> 00:03:52.380
I believe we're set to get a look at her data when she scans her My Ticket tomorrow.

00:03:52.380 --> 00:03:55.170
And I'll share whatever we learn with you.

00:03:57.760 --> 00:04:00.540
Tomorrow's the big day, Falulu!

00:04:00.540 --> 00:04:04.510
And, uh, Non really wanted to talk to you before that.

00:04:04.510 --> 00:04:09.070
My Lady Falulu! I loved the new Making Drama!

00:04:09.180 --> 00:04:10.230
Thank you.

00:04:10.230 --> 00:04:12.910
I'll be cheering my
heart out for you tomorrow!

00:04:13.230 --> 00:04:15.350
Good night!

00:04:15.350 --> 00:04:18.640
Why's it gotta be just one side that wins?

00:04:18.640 --> 00:04:23.240
I can't pick just cutlets or just cake! This is too much!

00:04:25.260 --> 00:04:28.120
But wow, I'm super excited!

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:28.170
So am I!
But wow, I'm super excited!

00:04:28.170 --> 00:04:29.350
So am I!

00:04:30.150 --> 00:04:31.000
Oh yeah!

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:32.460
I have a favor to ask!

00:04:33.850 --> 00:04:35.290
What?
What?

00:04:35.290 --> 00:04:36.580
After you.

00:04:36.580 --> 00:04:37.800
No, after you!

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:42.210
<i>Okay, let's both say it after the show tomorrow!</i>

00:04:42.210 --> 00:04:43.470
Okay, got it.

00:04:43.790 --> 00:04:45.930
<i>What could your favor be?</i>

00:04:46.370 --> 00:04:49.930
I've never seen Falulu like that...

00:04:52.350 --> 00:04:55.270
She is a Vocal Doll born out of a PriTicket...

00:05:00.020 --> 00:05:04.120
Why do I feel so restless?

00:05:06.650 --> 00:05:07.570
Newsflash!

00:05:07.890 --> 00:05:13.230
The Idol Grand Prix preliminaries were held, but none of the participating teams qualified.

00:05:13.230 --> 00:05:16.250
As such, the ParaPri finalists,

00:05:16.250 --> 00:05:20.290
Falulu and SoLaMi Dressing will be our only contestants.

00:05:20.290 --> 00:05:25.470
And SoLaMi Dressing is—would you believe it—made up of students of our school!

00:05:25.470 --> 00:05:28.400
Cultivating friendships is just as important as studying.

00:05:28.400 --> 00:05:30.980
Or rather, even more important!

00:05:30.980 --> 00:05:35.050
And through PriPara these six have truly demonstrated that.

00:05:35.050 --> 00:05:38.120
They are the pride of Paprika Academy!

00:05:38.120 --> 00:05:39.830
Go get 'em, girls!

00:05:41.190 --> 00:05:43.920
Minami, I will be watching!

00:05:43.920 --> 00:05:44.860
Always watching!

00:05:52.240 --> 00:05:54.300
What do I do?

00:05:54.300 --> 00:05:58.860
My heartbeats are 2.75 times as fast as usual-pri!

00:05:58.860 --> 00:06:00.190
How pathetic-kuma!

00:06:00.190 --> 00:06:01.170
Usa!

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:04.770
Compare yourselves to me, who has overcome so much.

00:06:04.770 --> 00:06:05.880
Or me!

00:06:06.410 --> 00:06:08.890
What are you doing getting nervous?

00:06:13.180 --> 00:06:17.520
Oh dear, is the rubbish getting carted on stage again?

00:06:17.880 --> 00:06:19.760
You never learn, do you?

00:06:19.760 --> 00:06:24.410
Give it however many times you like, your chances of winning are slimmer than the tip of my horn.

00:06:24.410 --> 00:06:26.130
Th-That's not true-usa!

00:06:26.130 --> 00:06:28.920
That's right-kuma! We've totally got a bit more than the tip!

00:06:28.920 --> 00:06:30.830
Well, good luck, losers.

00:06:30.830 --> 00:06:34.210
Maybe I'll spare you a couple of my names if it goes well!

00:06:43.600 --> 00:06:45.640
Let's both give it our best, Falulu.

00:06:45.640 --> 00:06:47.440
You're truly a worthy opponent.

00:06:47.440 --> 00:06:48.840
Don't expect any mercy from me.

00:06:49.160 --> 00:06:52.550
We've trained just as hard as you.

00:06:57.780 --> 00:06:58.730
Falulu.

00:07:01.420 --> 00:07:02.690
Lala.

00:07:05.200 --> 00:07:07.870
Shine! Next Idol Grand Prix!

00:07:10.510 --> 00:07:15.270
The curtains are about to rise here at the PriPara TV Rooftop Special Stage!

00:07:16.610 --> 00:07:22.510
Will the champion of ParaPri, Falulu win? Or will SoLaMi Dressing make a comeback?

00:07:22.510 --> 00:07:26.790
The winning team will receive the Paradise Coord!

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:30.400
Fight!

00:07:30.400 --> 00:07:31.150
You can do it!

00:07:31.150 --> 00:07:33.090
Minami!

00:07:35.420 --> 00:07:38.430
Viva SoLaMi Dressingracchi!

00:07:40.980 --> 00:07:43.230
Finally, we get to sing our new song!

00:07:43.530 --> 00:07:46.430
You gotta be getting more relaxed by now too, right?

00:07:46.430 --> 00:07:47.150
Yeah!

00:07:47.700 --> 00:07:50.860
I'm so happy. To get to perform together again.

00:07:50.860 --> 00:07:52.360
And to compete against Falulu again!

00:07:52.720 --> 00:07:53.820
Agreed.

00:07:54.100 --> 00:07:55.280
I can't wait.

00:07:55.610 --> 00:08:02.750
I feel like this thing is going to be way more important than who wins or loses...

00:08:03.110 --> 00:08:05.460
Yeah! May our feelings...

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:07.620
Reach the audience!

00:08:19.470 --> 00:08:21.890
Please scan the appropriate amount of My Tickets for your coord.

00:08:27.180 --> 00:08:29.190
You may also scan Friend Tickets.

00:08:30.500 --> 00:08:32.610
Coord Change Start!

00:08:37.310 --> 00:08:44.100
SoLaMi Dressing is going with Idol Coord, with matching gingham patterns and ribbons for everyone.

00:08:45.540 --> 00:08:49.460
The SoLaMi SMILE trio is looking really cute in bright colors.

00:08:51.000 --> 00:08:56.540
Shake that voluminous, frilly skirt good!

00:08:57.440 --> 00:08:59.350
Wish Ribbon Idol Coord!

00:09:00.440 --> 00:09:01.260
Pri!

00:09:03.810 --> 00:09:09.810
And the Dressing Pafé trio matches chic colors with an edgy design for a super cool look.

00:09:10.620 --> 00:09:14.840
The thigh-length boots and short shorts make for a great match.

00:09:16.540 --> 00:09:20.630
It's the last chance to get that Paradise Coord. Good luck to everyone!

00:09:21.540 --> 00:09:23.750
Nocturne Sky Idol Coord!

00:09:24.220 --> 00:09:24.850
Go!

00:09:24.850 --> 00:09:25.720
Yay!

00:09:36.580 --> 00:09:38.450
Lala, fight!

00:09:38.450 --> 00:09:40.760
You'll be the ace of PriPara yet! Lovely!

00:09:41.110 --> 00:09:44.000
Sophie! You lot! I'm tera-cosmic cheering for you!

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:45.480
Lady Sophie!

00:09:46.800 --> 00:09:49.820
<i>May our feelings reach you with this song!</i>

00:11:03.450 --> 00:11:03.800
Let's go!

00:11:03.800 --> 00:11:07.390
Lala. Shining. Prism Voice!

00:11:07.900 --> 00:11:11.810
Falulu's rival! Falulu's friend!

00:11:13.310 --> 00:11:16.650
Making Drama Switch On!

00:11:23.760 --> 00:11:24.870
Pri...

00:11:24.870 --> 00:11:26.000
Pshu...

00:11:26.000 --> 00:11:26.610
Go.

00:11:26.610 --> 00:11:28.000
Max!

00:11:31.330 --> 00:11:31.600
There!

00:11:32.820 --> 00:11:33.850
Pri...

00:11:34.680 --> 00:11:36.040
Eat it!

00:11:36.040 --> 00:11:36.810
Gotcha!

00:11:36.810 --> 00:11:37.340
Pshu...

00:11:41.100 --> 00:11:44.350
Let's play together! PriPara Hills!

00:11:45.480 --> 00:11:48.250
Good night.

00:11:51.220 --> 00:11:54.000
Cyalume Change!

00:12:06.540 --> 00:12:08.790
To think hey were such a mess in the start.

00:12:08.790 --> 00:12:12.170
Lala, Mireille, Sophie, you're all so radiant-kuma!

00:12:12.170 --> 00:12:14.790
Your hearts have found their way into the world of the lyrics-kuma!

00:12:46.590 --> 00:12:48.780
Amazing! They're better than ever!

00:12:49.060 --> 00:12:51.540
Wonderful, SoLaMi Dressing!

00:12:51.540 --> 00:12:53.290
That was yogreat!

00:12:55.510 --> 00:12:56.800
Thank you!

00:12:58.080 --> 00:13:00.710
And next on stage: Falulu!

00:13:03.960 --> 00:13:08.640
Falulu, that Making Drama from before... You'd better drop that.

00:13:09.080 --> 00:13:14.720
The better move would be to copy the Making Dramas of <i>everyone</i> in PriPara!

00:13:14.720 --> 00:13:17.680
You've studied so hard, I know you can do it!

00:13:17.680 --> 00:13:20.610
Do that and you'll win by a landslide, no doubt!

00:13:23.830 --> 00:13:25.720
Thank you, Unicorn.

00:13:25.720 --> 00:13:29.030
You taught me lots about PriPara.

00:13:29.330 --> 00:13:30.000
What?

00:13:30.520 --> 00:13:38.120
But Falulu wants to find a sparkly thing more important than just winning or losing.

00:13:38.120 --> 00:13:39.040
Falulu...

00:13:39.380 --> 00:13:41.620
Unicorn, watch closely.

00:13:41.620 --> 00:13:44.480
See Falulu work her hardest.

00:13:48.520 --> 00:13:49.650
What is it?

00:13:50.430 --> 00:13:51.980
Nothing!

00:13:51.980 --> 00:13:55.270
I'll save my tears for when you win.

00:13:57.150 --> 00:13:58.270
Yeah!

00:14:04.070 --> 00:14:05.900
Coord Change Start!

00:14:07.610 --> 00:14:11.230
Silver stones and reliefs make this one elegant winter coord!

00:14:11.230 --> 00:14:12.870
Lovely stuff!

00:14:12.870 --> 00:14:15.570
Crystal Snow Princess Coord!

00:14:25.590 --> 00:14:27.330
Lady Falulu!

00:14:27.330 --> 00:14:28.550
You're the best!

00:15:40.650 --> 00:15:43.000
Falulu is somehow different today!

00:15:43.000 --> 00:15:46.340
Yeah! She's really sparkling! It's the Prism Voice!

00:15:47.070 --> 00:15:48.550
And she's my friend!

00:15:56.560 --> 00:15:59.750
Making Drama Switch On!

00:16:01.920 --> 00:16:05.250
<i>Falulu wants to grow it more and more!</i>

00:16:28.060 --> 00:16:30.100
For you!

00:16:30.100 --> 00:16:33.790
Tick Tock Flower!

00:16:37.320 --> 00:16:39.700
Cyalume Change!

00:17:13.630 --> 00:17:15.930
Falulu has definitely changed.

00:17:16.740 --> 00:17:18.890
She wants to bloom brighter!

00:17:19.340 --> 00:17:22.850
You can really tell how into it she is today!

00:17:23.210 --> 00:17:26.480
But it kinda feels unfinished.

00:17:26.860 --> 00:17:29.190
Falulu, you're the best!

00:17:29.480 --> 00:17:32.220
And finally, it's time to announce our results!

00:18:01.000 --> 00:18:04.480
It's a small difference, but SoLaMi Dressing wins!

00:18:14.970 --> 00:18:17.530
Fa... Falulu...

00:18:24.800 --> 00:18:26.920
We finally won!

00:18:26.920 --> 00:18:29.920
And we all get to be here!

00:18:30.190 --> 00:18:33.280
All six of us got the Paradise Coord!

00:18:33.280 --> 00:18:34.130
Someone pinch me!

00:18:34.920 --> 00:18:37.880
I'm glad we kept going!

00:18:38.510 --> 00:18:39.200
Yeah!

00:18:40.110 --> 00:18:42.400
Congratulations!

00:18:42.400 --> 00:18:44.060
Chanko!

00:18:44.060 --> 00:18:48.520
Let's drink! Happy day-kuma! I'll even toast with you today!

00:18:48.520 --> 00:18:54.350
I'm so happy that even your rotten lump of bread for a face seems cute-usa!

00:18:54.350 --> 00:18:58.710
And those moldy bamboo sticks you call ears look downright attractive-kuma!

00:18:59.210 --> 00:19:00.680
Cheers!

00:19:04.690 --> 00:19:05.860
Wha-Wha-Wha?

00:19:12.640 --> 00:19:15.400
Where did you go, Falulu?

00:19:28.030 --> 00:19:29.010
Falulu.

00:19:29.960 --> 00:19:32.610
Falulu lost.

00:19:34.000 --> 00:19:36.400
For the first time ever.

00:19:39.020 --> 00:19:41.590
But it's weird.

00:19:41.590 --> 00:19:43.870
I'm still happy!

00:19:44.410 --> 00:19:45.070
Huh?

00:19:45.970 --> 00:19:51.730
Because I've got lots of warm sparkly stuff right here.

00:19:52.840 --> 00:19:55.380
So I am truly happy.

00:19:56.160 --> 00:19:57.170
Falulu!

00:19:58.750 --> 00:20:00.340
It was a great battle!

00:20:00.660 --> 00:20:01.760
Yeah!

00:20:02.320 --> 00:20:05.020
Your show was really lovely too!

00:20:05.020 --> 00:20:06.220
It was captivating.

00:20:06.720 --> 00:20:08.180
Really was-pri!

00:20:13.110 --> 00:20:14.460
Lady Falulu!

00:20:14.460 --> 00:20:16.510
We love you!

00:20:16.510 --> 00:20:17.560
Lala.

00:20:19.080 --> 00:20:20.240
Falulu.

00:20:20.580 --> 00:20:22.260
I have a favor to ask.

00:20:23.740 --> 00:20:24.450
Let's snap!
Let's snap!

00:20:25.540 --> 00:20:27.410
Stooop!

00:20:29.900 --> 00:20:31.890
Th-This is...

00:20:39.130 --> 00:20:43.000
Falulu! Don't snap it!

00:21:08.160 --> 00:21:09.030
Falulu?!

00:21:18.980 --> 00:21:20.650
Keep it together, Falulu!

00:21:24.870 --> 00:21:33.370
Falulu!

00:23:06.000 --> 00:23:09.370
Falulu? Why? What happened?

00:23:09.370 --> 00:23:12.450
You led her astray!

00:23:12.450 --> 00:23:14.740
It's all your fault!

00:23:14.740 --> 00:23:17.970
No way! I want to help Falulu!

00:23:17.970 --> 00:23:20.160
Just you wait, I <i>will</i> help her!

00:23:20.160 --> 00:23:22.580
I don't need your help!

00:23:22.580 --> 00:23:28.100
I'll wake my Falulu dear up myself!

00:23:28.590 --> 00:23:32.460
Next time: Falulu, Wake Up!!

00:23:32.460 --> 00:23:36.460
Go for it! Let's go! PriPara!
